     5787       run clcprtsl_calc-ttable in this-procedure
     5788         (input yes,
     5789          input yes,
     5790          input bf_doc-line.road-tax,
     5791          input bf_doc-line.excise,
     5792          input bf_doc-line.vat-pc,
     5793          input bf_doc-line.cons-vat-pc,
     5794          input bf_doc-line.slt-pc,
     5795          input bf_trn-doc.base-rate,
     5796          input bf_trn-doc.base-scale,
