     6642       field Name         as character
     6643       field pokazately   as character
     6644       field UAES         as character
     6645       field OKEI         as character
     6646       field EI           as character
     6647       field qnty         as character
     6648       field price        as character
     6649       field SumNoVAT     as character
     6650       field SumActciz    as character
     6651       field VATpc        as character
     6652       field VATsum       as character
     6653       field sum          as character
     6654       field countrycode  as character
     6655       field country      as character
