     8491          and out-vatp_doc-line.artic      = doc-line.artic
     8492          and out-vatp_doc-line.prod-type  = doc-line.prod-type
     8493          and out-vatp_doc-line.prod-code  = doc-line.prod-code no-lock no-error.
     8494   if available out-vatp_doc-line           and
